github-light-default.json and github-dark-default.json are GitHub's VS Code color themes from
https://github.com/primer/github-vscode-theme, as packaged by @shikijs/themes 4.5.0 (the copy the
Theorem UI highlights chat code with). The dark theme's symbolIcon.constantForeground, an
array rather than a colour in that release, is left out, as Theia and VS Code drop it when loading.

